/*************************************************************************
 *  Attendance.gs — the Attendance Report app, inside One Login.
 *
 *  Same spreadsheet (Settings ▸ Attendance Sheet ID), same tabs, same
 *  rules and the same engine as the standalone app — Config, Location
 *  Rules, Shift Config, Penalty Rules, Employee Shift, ID Mapping,
 *  Manual Penalty, Attendance Data, Report History, Audit Log — so both
 *  can run side by side. Nobody signs in to the old app any more: HR
 *  opens "Attendance Manager" here with their own login.
 *
 *    hr_attendance  upload, day view, edit a row, map IDs, Excel report,
 *                   report history (penalties: Penalty.gs, own section)
 *    att_config     + edit Config / Location Rules / Shift Config /
 *                   Penalty Rules / Employee Shift, remove a whole day
 *************************************************************************/

